   '<b>case 1</b>, the near anchor takes its half and breaks out at c<sub>a1</sub> = %g; <b>case 2</b>, the near anchor has slipped or broken out and the far one takes all, at c<sub>a1</sub> = %g.</li>'], S.ca1(1), S.ca1(2));
w('<li>Basic strength (17.7.2.2.1): V<sub>b</sub> = min[0.6 (l<sub>e</sub>/d<sub>a</sub>)<sup>0.2</sup> &radic;d<sub>a</sub> &lambda; &radic;f''<sub>c</sub> c<sub>a1</sub><sup>1.5</sup>, 3.7 &lambda; &radic;f''<sub>c</sub> c<sub>a1</sub><sup>1.5</sup>], l<sub>e</sub> = h<sub>ef</sub> = %g &le; 8 d<sub>a</sub> = %g, d<sub>a</sub> = %g. Case 1: %.1f kN; case 2: %.1f kN.</li>', S.le, 8*an.db, an.db, S.Vb(1)*kN, S.Vb(2)*kN);
