       '&psi;<sub>ed,V</sub> = %.2f, &psi;<sub>c,V</sub> = 1.0 (cracked, edge bars not counted), &psi;<sub>h,V</sub> = %.2f. V<sub>cb</sub> = %.3f &times; %.2f &times; %.1f = %.1f kN; &phi; = 0.70: <b>%.1f kN</b> perpendicular to the edge, and <b>%.1f kN</b> parallel to it (2 &times; with &psi;<sub>ed,V</sub> = 1, 17.7.2.1(c)).</li>'], ...
      i, S.ca1(i), r, S.ctop, r, r, S.ha, r, S.Avc(i), S.Avco(i), S.pedV(i), S.ph(i), S.Avc(i)/S.Avco(i), S.pedV(i), S.Vb(i)*kN, S.Vcb(i)*kN, S.phiVb(i)*kN, S.phiVp(i)*kN);
end
